🚂 힐링이 필요할 때, 곡성으로 떠나보세요!
자연, 역사, 전통이 어우러진 아름다운 곡성에서 마음의 여유를 찾을 수 있습니다.


⛰️ Discover the Harmony of Nature and Tradition in Gokseong, Korea!

Nestled alongside the clear waters of the Seomjin River and surrounded by lush green mountains, Gokseong is a perfect destination for those seeking relaxation and healing.
From nostalgic train rides to the fragrant Rose Park and the peaceful Amnok Riverside, experience the unique charm of this beautiful town.

📍 Featured Locations in the Video

Gokseong Train Village

Seomjin River Railbike

Gokseong World Rose Festival (Rose Park)

Amnok Riverside Park

Dorimsa Temple and Mt. Dongak

Gajeong Station and Steam Locomotive

🚂 When you need a break, take a trip to Gokseong!
A place where nature, history, and tradition come together to soothe your soul.

