설명:
Hello. I visited Changgyeonggung Palace in Seoul, known for its beautiful autumn foliage, and nearby cafes and restaurants in Insadong, and then watched the sunset from Namsan Mountain.

I hope you enjoy the MIHARU VLOG.

Subtitles are machine translated, so there may be errors.


