Hello Nadoongies~💗 How have you been this week with the stormy weather?🙂 I tried the Diore laser treatment for the first time, and the downtime is longer than I expected, so I''ve been stuck at home for two days🥹🥹 (It''s called a baby laser; let''s see if it really makes my skin baby-soft…!!!)

Today, I''ve prepared a vlog of my trip to Jeju from last week (You all were waiting for it, right?🥹) It was short but so much fun. It was hilarious and enjoyable because Hee-doo, Min-young, and Joo-hwi oppa and I have so much in common🤣🤣❤️. I hope you enjoy watching it…💗

Also, for those planning a trip to Jeju, I have some restaurant recommendations before I go. Have a great day today🙏🏻

1. Mackerel Sashimi Restaurants
- Mi-Young''s Place
- Jari-Dom Sashimi House

2. Black Pork Restaurants
- Borumsup
- Byeoldonbyeol

3. Sweet Shrimp Sashimi Restaurants
- Gorae Gorae (My last night snack… Check out the visuals…❤️)

4. Café Recommendations
- Oui Café Jeju!! (I wanted to go but couldn’t. Make sure you visit it…💗)

